The public repository itself is used to publish license documents, documentation, and free-edition release packages. Publication of this repository does not mean that the Hakoniwa Conductor source code is publicly licensed or made available.

Commercial use requires a separate Hakoniwa Conductor PRO license agreement with Hakoniwa Lab LLC.

Third-party components and files carrying their own license notices remain subject to their respective license terms.

In the event of any discrepancy between the Japanese and English versions of the free/non-commercial license, the Japanese version shall prevail.
